{%- comment -%}
  A bold heading line, then a list of benefits, each with a filled circle and a white tick inside (the same icon as goda.co) in front of it. The benefits are in Libre Caslon Text. The bold heading uses your theme's own text font (the same font as the "Powerful Support for Joints..." line), so it always matches the rest of your product page.
  WHERE: Online Store > Themes > Customize > Product page > Product information > Add block > Custom Liquid, drag it where you want it, paste this in.
  EDIT YOUR CONTENT BELOW.
  mb_intro = the bold line at the top (leave it empty to hide it). Use &amp; for an ampersand and &#39; for an apostrophe.
  mb_data = one benefit per line, with @@ on its own line between them.
    Each benefit gets the circle with the white tick. To use your own little picture instead, add ||| and the image link after the text,
    e.g.  Deep hydration where your skin needs it most ||| https://cdn.shopify.com/...png
  mb_text = colour of all the text (locked so the theme cannot change it). mb_icon_color = colour of the circles (#b72e35 is goda's red, #dea531 is your gold). The tick is see-through, so it always shows the colour behind the block (white on a white page).
  mb_top / mb_bottom = space above and below this block. The block is already trimmed tight inside; the two settings start at -4px, which pulls it a little closer to what is above and below it. Use 0px for normal spacing, a bigger minus (for example -10px) to pull it even closer, or a plus number to add space.
  On phones each benefit shrinks just enough to stay on ONE line (it sizes itself from your longest benefit and the width of the block).
  Do not use a straight apostrophe (') inside the text, use &#39; instead.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mb_intro = 'Deep Hydration for Dry, Crepey &amp; Itchy Menopausal Skin' -%}
{%- capture mb_data -%}
Firms, smooths and tightens crepey skin
@@
Deeply hydrates menopausal skin for 24 hours
@@
Calms itchy skin so you sleep all night
@@
Recommended by Dermatologists
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign mb_text = '#2a110a' -%}
{%- assign mb_icon_color = '#b72e35' -%}
{%- assign mb_top = '-4px' -%}
{%- assign mb_bottom = '-4px' -%}
{%- assign mb_maxlen = 20 -%}
{%- assign mb_pre = mb_data | split: '@@' -%}
{%- for mb_p in mb_pre -%}{%- assign mb_pt = mb_p | split: '|||' | first | strip -%}{%- assign mb_pl = mb_pt | size -%}{%- if mb_pl > mb_maxlen -%}{%- assign mb_maxlen = mb_pl -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Libre+Caslon+Text:wght@400&display=swap" onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'">
<noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Libre+Caslon+Text:wght@400&display=swap"></noscript>

<style>
.mb-fl{container-type:inline-size;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;margin:var(--mb-fl-top) 0 var(--mb-fl-bottom);padding:0;text-align:left}
.mb-fl *{box-sizing:border-box}
.mb-fl__t{font-family:'Libre Caslon Text',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif!important;font-weight:400!important;font-style:normal!important;letter-spacing:0!important;text-transform:none!important;text-align:left!important;color:var(--mb-fl-tx)!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--mb-fl-tx)!important}
.mb-fl__intro{margin:0 0 12px;padding:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.25}
.mb-fl .mb-fl__intro{font-family:var(--text-font-family,inherit)!important;font-weight:700!important;font-style:normal!important;letter-spacing:var(--text-letter-spacing,0)!important;text-transform:none!important;text-align:left!important;color:var(--mb-fl-tx)!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--mb-fl-tx)!important}
.mb-fl__list{margin:0 0 -3px;padding:0;list-style:none}
.mb-fl__it{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.mb-fl__ic{display:block;flex:none;width:18px;height:18px;margin-top:3px}
.mb-fl__ic svg,.mb-fl__ic img{display:block;width:18px!important;height:18px!important;max-width:none!important;margin:0;padding:0;object-fit:contain}
.mb-fl__ic svg,.mb-fl__ic svg *{fill:var(--mb-fl-ic)!important;stroke:none!important}
.mb-fl__t{margin:0;padding:0;font-size:16px;line-height:24px}
@media screen and (max-width:749px){
.mb-fl__t{font-size:13px;font-size:clamp(11px,calc((100cqw - 28px) / (var(--mb-fl-ch) * .5)),16px)}
}
</style>

<div class="mb-fl" style="--mb-fl-ch:{{ mb_maxlen }};--mb-fl-tx:{{ mb_text }};--mb-fl-ic:{{ mb_icon_color }};--mb-fl-top:{{ mb_top }};--mb-fl-bottom:{{ mb_bottom }}">
{%- if mb_intro != blank -%}<p class="mb-fl__intro">{{ mb_intro }}</p>{%- endif -%}
<ul class="mb-fl__list">
{%- assign mb_items = mb_data | split: '@@' -%}
{%- for mb_item in mb_items -%}
{%- assign mb_f = mb_item | split: '|||' -%}
{%- assign mb_t = mb_f[0] | strip -%}
{%- assign mb_i = mb_f[1] | strip -%}
{%- if mb_t != blank -%}
<li class="mb-fl__it"><span class="mb-fl__ic">
{%- if mb_i != blank -%}<img src="{{ mb_i }}" width="18" height="18" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
{%- else -%}
<svg version="1.1" width="18px" height="18px" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g fill="{{ mb_icon_color }}" fill-rule="evenodd" stroke="none" stroke-width="1"><g fill="{{ mb_icon_color }}" transform="translate(-44.000000, -86.000000)"><g transform="translate(44.000000, 86.000000)"><path d="M10,0 C4.5,0 0,4.5 0,10 C0,15.5 4.5,20 10,20 C15.5,20 20,15.5 20,10 C20,4.5 15.5,0 10,0 L10,0 Z M8,15 L3,10 L4.4,8.6 L8,12.2 L15.6,4.6 L17,6 L8,15 L8,15 Z"></path></g></g></g></svg>
{%- endif -%}
</span><span class="mb-fl__t">{{ mb_t }}</span></li>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
</ul>
</div>
